Conversor ASCII de Texto para Numeros.

Esta receita recebe caracteres, descobre seus valores numericos ASCII 
e os serve quentinhos em uma bandeja.

Ingredients.
1 piece of text
1 termination chef

Method.
1. Take text from refrigerator.
2. Put text into the mixing bowl.
3. Clean mixing bowl.
4. Pour contents of mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.

Baking dish.
Take text from refrigerator.
Chop text.
Put text into the mixing bowl.
Liquefy mixing bowl.
Pour contents of mixing bowl into the baking dish.
